OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a mainly dry and bright
OL,6,Fstart to the morning cloud will spread
OL,7,Feast through the afternoon with some
OL,8,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain
OL,9,Ffollowing later. Best of the
OL,10,Fconditions likely for Fife.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRather cloudy with rain in
OL,13,Fthe evening, though perhaps remaining
OL,14,Fmainly dry for Fife. Rain becomes
OL,15,Fpersistent and heavier overnight and
OL,16,Fspreads east to all areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
