OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with
OL,6,Fpersistent and occasionally heavy
OL,7,Frain, and some blustery winds at
OL,8,Ftimes. This clears through the morning
OL,9,Fto allow increasing bright spells and
OL,10,Fa few showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,13,Fand bright Thursday morning with a
OL,14,Fband of cloud and rain passing
OL,15,Fsoutheast in the evening. Friday will
OL,16,Fbecome dry with sunny spells. Bright
OL,17,Fspells and some showers Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
